import{_ as n,o as i,c as t,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const u=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 663 | Time Domain and Law-First | Self-Consistency Proof of Time-Domain Laws","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 663 | Time Domain and Law-First | Self-Consistency Proof of Time-Domain Laws","no":663,"module":3,"tags":["Time Domain","Law-First","Self-Consistency","Law Self-Consistency","Setting Self-Consistency"],"related":["20-Anchor-Structure-and-Hierarchy","49-Governance-Framework-and-Power-Checks","27-Anchor Calibration and Maintenance"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0663_模块3-时间域与法则优先-时间域法则的自洽性论证.md","filePath":"en/0663_模块3-时间域与法则优先-时间域法则的自洽性论证.md"}'),s={name:"en/0663_模块3-时间域与法则优先-时间域法则的自洽性论证.md"};function o(r,e,l,c,h,m){return i(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-663-time-domain-and-law-first-self-consistency-proof-of-time-domain-laws" tabindex="-1">Entry 663 | Time Domain and Law-First | Self-Consistency Proof of Time-Domain Laws <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-663-time-domain-and-law-first-self-consistency-proof-of-time-domain-laws" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 663 | Time Domain and Law-First | Self-Consistency Proof of Time-Domain Laws&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain | Benchmark base: Documents 20, 49, 27 | Series: Time Domain and Law-First (Entry 1)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-law-first-axiom-is-not-a-slogan-but-an-engineering-standard" tabindex="-1">Introduction: law-first axiom is not a slogan, but an engineering standard <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-law-first-axiom-is-not-a-slogan-but-an-engineering-standard" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: law-first axiom is not a slogan, but an engineering standard&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Law-first axiom is one of the six top-level axioms. Its core requirement: <strong>laws first, never retcon, never unfinished; setting self-consistency above plot convenience</strong>. But &quot;self-consistency&quot; is not a vague philosophical concept — in the time domain&#39;s concrete settings, self-consistency must be engineering-proved, structurally tested, continuously maintained. This entry proves: why are the dual-track time domain&#39;s law settings self-consistent at the engineering standard?</p><p>Six top-level axioms here, law-first axiom is this entry&#39;s core testing standard. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. The other four axioms — anti-predation, republican of Myriad Races, collective ascension, causal self-discipline — constitute the content standard for time-domain law self-consistency. This entry structurally proves: the time-domain law settings satisfy all requirements of law-first axiom.</p><h2 id="i-five-dimensions-of-self-consistency-testing" tabindex="-1">I. Five Dimensions of Self-Consistency Testing <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-five-dimensions-of-self-consistency-testing" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Five Dimensions of Self-Consistency Testing&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_1-1-dimension-1-internal-consistency-test" tabindex="-1">1.1 Dimension 1: Internal Consistency Test <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-1-dimension-1-internal-consistency-test" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.1 Dimension 1: Internal Consistency Test&quot;">​</a></h3><p>All settings inside the time domain — Origin Acceleration Domain flow rate, Quest Sediment Domain immersion, switching process, allocation mechanism, backflow rules — must be consistent with each other, may not contradict. Test method: put all time-domain law clauses on one table, pairwise check for logical conflicts. After testing, there are no contradictions among the dual-track time domain&#39;s law clauses: acceleration-domain allocation rules do not conflict with backflow rules; Quest-domain exit right does not conflict with trial design; cross-plane reporting process does not conflict with causal-closure principle.</p><h3 id="_1-2-dimension-2-consistency-with-the-overall-law-network-test" tabindex="-1">1.2 Dimension 2: Consistency with the Overall Law Network Test <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-2-dimension-2-consistency-with-the-overall-law-network-test" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.2 Dimension 2: Consistency with the Overall Law Network Test&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Time-domain laws may not conflict with other parts of the law network. Test method: compare time-domain laws with Document 20 anchor structure and hierarchy, Document 15 energy-cycle law, Document 14 cultivation-realm division and other core laws. Conclusion: time-domain laws are the time-dimensional extension of the law network, do not conflict with any existing law.</p><h3 id="_1-3-dimension-3-causal-consistency-test" tabindex="-1">1.3 Dimension 3: Causal Consistency Test <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-3-dimension-3-causal-consistency-test" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.3 Dimension 3: Causal Consistency Test&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Each time-domain operation must have corresponding causal-effect definition (Entry 640 time-causal unity). Test method: list all time-domain operation types, confirm each operation has clear causal-effect description and audit mechanism. Conclusion: all operation types are covered by three handling ways — causal closure, causal desensitization, causal reporting.</p><h3 id="_1-4-dimension-4-expansion-consistency-test" tabindex="-1">1.4 Dimension 4: Expansion Consistency Test <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-4-dimension-4-expansion-consistency-test" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.4 Dimension 4: Expansion Consistency Test&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Time-domain laws must support infinite expansion (Entry 664); new planes entering, new clans using, new functions developed may not lead to law contradiction. Test method: simulate new-plane entry scenarios, verify whether the existing law framework may naturally cover them. Conclusion: the law framework&#39;s open design ensures expansion does not produce contradictions.</p><h3 id="_1-5-dimension-5-governance-consistency-test" tabindex="-1">1.5 Dimension 5: Governance Consistency Test <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-5-dimension-5-governance-consistency-test" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.5 Dimension 5: Governance Consistency Test&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Time-domain laws must be consistent with the governance system — Anchor Council, Symbiotic Executive Committee, symbiotic court, Anchor Supervisory Committee. Test method: confirm the time domain&#39;s four-power division of legislation, administration, judiciary, supervision fully aligns with Document 49 governance framework. Conclusion: four-power division consistent; time-domain-abuse trial (Entry 619) seamlessly interfaces with the judicial system.</p><h2 id="ii-self-consistency-maintenance-mechanisms" tabindex="-1">II. Self-Consistency Maintenance Mechanisms <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-self-consistency-maintenance-mechanisms" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Self-Consistency Maintenance Mechanisms&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Self-consistency is not ended with one proof — it needs continuous maintenance:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Maintenance Mechanism</th><th>Content</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>New-Law Review</td><td>Any new time-domain function proposal must first pass self-consistency review before project approval</td></tr><tr><td>Periodic Verification</td><td>Anchor Supervisory Committee periodically verifies time-domain laws&#39; consistency with the overall law network</td></tr><tr><td>Conflict Warning</td><td>When a new cultivation system or technology may conflict with time-domain laws, the Alaya Network auto-warns</td></tr><tr><td>Correction Process</td><td>When self-consistency problems are discovered, the Anchor Council legislates correction; plot bypass is not allowed</td></tr></tbody></table><p>These maintenance mechanisms ensure time-domain laws always remain self-consistent — this is law-first axiom&#39;s implementation at the engineering level.</p><h2 id="iii-contrast-with-the-predatory-faction-s-retcon-and-abandon" tabindex="-1">III. Contrast with the Predatory Faction&#39;s &quot;Retcon-and-Abandon&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-contrast-with-the-predatory-faction-s-retcon-and-abandon" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Contrast with the Predatory Faction&#39;s &quot;Retcon-and-Abandon&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Predatory-faction systems&#39; setting self-consistency is generally low:</p><ul><li>Shrouding-the-Heavens: the power system set early is repeatedly broken later;</li><li>Douluo: the spirit-ring system&#39;s rules change with the protagonist&#39;s needs;</li><li>Dragon Ball: power numbers are completely incomparable; late stage completely collapses;</li><li>Tang-Luo: the protagonist&#39;s abilities are arbitrarily added with plot needs.</li></ul><p>The common problem of these systems: plot convenience kidnaps setting self-consistency — when the author needs a thrill he breaks the rules. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s law-first axiom precisely forbids this: <strong>setting self-consistency above plot convenience</strong>.</p><h2 id="iv-the-philosophical-meaning-of-self-consistency" tabindex="-1">IV. The Philosophical Meaning of Self-Consistency <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-the-philosophical-meaning-of-self-consistency" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. The Philosophical Meaning of Self-Consistency&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Law self-consistency is not only a technical requirement, but a philosophical commitment: it means civilization&#39;s laws are not tools that may be arbitrarily changed, but the cornerstone on which civilization depends for survival. If laws may be changed with plot convenience, then Myriad Ranks&#39; trust in laws collapses — no one will obey a rule that may be modified at any time. Law self-consistency is the premise of civilizational rule of law.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: self-consistency testing ensures time-domain laws do not produce chaos because of contradictions; every bit of time resource flows within the self-consistent law framework</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: law self-consistency ensures no &quot;law loopholes&quot; may be exploited for predation; all paths in the time domain are within the self-consistent law framework</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo system&#39;s settings are retconned with plot convenience, self-consistency extremely low; Heng Yuan Zhou law-first, setting self-consistency above all</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: self-consistency testing covers the time domain&#39;s application to all beings of Myriad Ranks; laws do not have contradictions because of different races</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: self-consistency testing&#39;s five-dimension model, maintenance mechanisms, correction process all public; newly merged planes接入 the same self-consistency guarantee system; the law-self-consistency framework leading to the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm may infinitely expand</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Time-domain laws&#39; self-consistency is not self-boasting, but proved through five dimensions of engineering testing: internal consistency, overall consistency, causal consistency, expansion consistency, governance consistency. These tests are not one-time — periodic verification, conflict warning, correction process ensure self-consistency continuously maintained. <strong>Law-first axiom&#39;s core is not the empty phrase &quot;laws are important,&quot; but the executable, testable, maintainable engineering standard &quot;law self-consistency above plot convenience.&quot;</strong> Time-domain laws have passed this standard — this is the dual-track time domain system&#39;s setting-self-consistency fundamental guarantee.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/20-锚点结构与层级.html">Entry 20 · Anchor-Structure-and-Hierarchy</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/49-治理框架与权力制衡.html">Entry 49 · Governance-Framework-and-Power-Checks</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/27-锚点校准与维护.html">Entry 27 · Anchor Calibration and Maintenance</a> · <a href="./664_模块3-时间域与法则优先-时间域设定的无限扩容性.html">Entry 664 · Infinite Expandability of Time-Domain Settings</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',32)])])}const f=n(s,[["render",o]]);export{u as __pageData,f as default};
